        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras_big/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221 width=1560 height=840 /></span>Simple Pure Play is a game that allows players to participate in the game design process, helping them understand the impact of sound, graphics, and settings on gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Rhythm and melody gameplay with built-in composition features  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the built-in tracks, players can add songs by loading local mp3, wav, mp4, and mid files.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a song editing feature, allowing import and export of mid files, giving players more freedom to choose their music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras_big/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221 width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/8ccb0bd99b0d2650665bbb8b95819496.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Link Matching Game with Built-in Drawing Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of the link matching game is very simple: you just need to connect two identical shapes to eliminate them. The most important part of creating this gameplay is the shapes themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a shape drawing tool that allows you to create your own shapes, and the link matching game is connected to the template list of these shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you can freely edit the shapes displayed in the link matching game, and the game also has a feature that allows you to directly use local images to generate level content.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/477d8ef1f5ab9c2777c88a950ba8051d.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/fcbb79c3a14ffe066088b34428c52281.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Match-3 with Built-in Level Configuration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The match-3 gameplay involves swapping the positions of two shapes to form a line and then eliminating them. Different mechanisms and items are added, and these special shapes trigger various effects when removed. How these mechanisms and items are placed, as well as the conditions for completing a level, are all set through configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely modify the level completion conditions and the positions of mechanisms and items through the level configuration interface, allowing them to understand how configuration affects the game's entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/bdd6af0021680dfcaac08c8fc44a95c6.avif?t=1767704221\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras_big/bdd6af0021680dfcaac08c8fc44a95c6.avif?t=1767704221 width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/62e8cf5322066567acce35080b5c9016.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Tank Maze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a tank to navigate through a maze, which is randomly generated along with the obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different tanks have different basic stats, as well as different bullets and skills. Upgrading your equipment allows you to pass through the maze more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a two-player mode and a night mode. Especially in night mode, the difficulty changes drastically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/4eaa2c546b49beddb52ebd22f4005e6b.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=886 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/51ab37e70c3d76b7fcd6508cda77cca7.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Two-Player Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All game modes have a two-player option, supporting both keyboard and controller for local co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras_big/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221 width=1560 height=840 /></span>Simple Pure Play is a game that allows players to participate in the game design process, helping them understand the impact of sound, graphics, and settings on gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Rhythm and melody gameplay with built-in composition features  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the built-in tracks, players can add songs by loading local mp3, wav, mp4, and mid files.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a song editing feature, allowing import and export of mid files, giving players more freedom to choose their music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras_big/01061d959515994ef6fca978950cba4f.avif?t=1767704221 width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/8ccb0bd99b0d2650665bbb8b95819496.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Link Matching Game with Built-in Drawing Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of the link matching game is very simple: you just need to connect two identical shapes to eliminate them. The most important part of creating this gameplay is the shapes themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gam