mg class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/62e8cf5322066567acce35080b5c9016.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Tank Maze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a tank to navigate through a maze, which is randomly generated along with the obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different tanks have different basic stats, as well as different bullets and skills. Upgrading your equipment allows you to pass through the maze more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a two-player mode and a night mode. Especially in night mode, the difficulty changes drastically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/4eaa2c546b49beddb52ebd22f4005e6b.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=886 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850220/extras/51ab37e70c3d76b7fcd6508cda77cca7.avif?t=1767704221\" width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Two-Player Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All game modes have a two-player option, supporting both keyboard and controller for local co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
